    ("Which email authentication duo uses DNS TXT records to list authorized sending IPs and sign message headers cryptographically?", "SPF and DKIM", ["DMARC and BGP", "SMTP and IMAP", "POP3 and STARTTLS"], "DMARC builds policy alignment atop SPF and DKIM."),
